Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.74,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}County attrition modifiers also work in stages.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.00,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}县损耗的修正也分几层。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.00,0:00:07.49,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}再看一组假设输入：全军三千零一人，基础
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.74,0:00:07.25,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}Consider hypothetical inputs: 3,001 soldiers,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.25,0:00:10.93,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}a base rate of 5%, and a multiplier of 0.33339.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.49,0:00:11.97,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}比例百分之五，修正倍率零点三三三三九。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.93,0:00:14.17,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}The effective rate is first calculated as
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.97,0:00:15.86,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}先得到有效比例百分之一点六六六，再
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.17,0:00:17.33,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}1.666%, then applied to the troop count,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.86,0:00:19.75,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}算人数，是四十九；对应的最小值修正
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.33,0:00:18.12,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}giving 49.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.12,0:00:23.23,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}The corresponding modified minimum is 33, so this example uses 49.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.75,0:00:23.64,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}后是三十三，这组输入最后取四十九。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.23,0:00:25.78,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}Applying everything together and
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.64,0:00:28.74,Chinese,zh-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}把修正和人数合到最后才取整，就会多算成五十。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.78,0:00:28.56,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}rounding only at the end would give
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.56,0:00:28.80,English,en-9,0,0,0,,{\q2}50.
